{"name":"Karry","hex":"#fedcc1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Karry","blocks":[{"text":"Karry New Energy Holdings Co., Ltd. is a Chinese car manufacturer founded by Chery Automobile in 2009 specializing in the production of light commercial vehicles based in Anhui, Wuhu in China. It is a subsidiary of Chery Commercial Vehicle (Anhui) Co. Ltd. Following the IPO of Chery Automobile in 2025, the Karry and Chery Commercial Vehicle has been spun off and operated independently by Chery Holding Group, which has no capital ties with Chery Automobile anymore."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karry","wikidata":"Q96385439"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Karry_Dolphin_IMG008.jpg/500px-Karry_Dolphin_IMG008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Karry_Dolphin_IMG008.jpg/1280px-Karry_Dolphin_IMG008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Karry_Dolphin_IMG008.jpg/500px-Karry_Dolphin_IMG008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKarry_Dolphin_IMG008.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/2022_Karry_Porpoise_EV_%28front%29.jpg/500px-2022_Karry_Porpoise_EV_%28front%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/2022_Karry_Porpoise_EV_%28front%29.jpg/1280px-2022_Karry_Porpoise_EV_%28front%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/2022_Karry_Porpoise_EV_%28front%29.jpg/500px-2022_Karry_Porpoise_EV_%28front%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail",